{
  "id": "6af5ca7b6ccb7703ad2fd9ef",
  "title": "Muse(Meta)",
  "created": 1794493053,
  "updated": 1794497060,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7b6ccb7703ad2fd9ef",
      "text": "Muse(Meta)",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f59e",
      "text": "✂ from [Muse]",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5a0",
      "text": "[* Meta社のMuse]",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5a1",
      "text": "[https://gyazo.com/a1f1bccb35ebf1ac8bdfad19e14e6cf4]",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5a2",
      "text": "[inajob.icon]",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5a3",
      "text": " ライブブラウザ機能は画像認識してるのでトークン消費が激しい",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5a4",
      "text": "  XやAmazonはこの機能を使って見ているとのこと",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5a5",
      "text": "   Xはこうしないと弾かれるからなー[基素.icon]",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5a6",
      "text": " 試していること",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5a7",
      "text": " \tCosenseの定期チェック",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5a8",
      "text": " \tXの閲覧（トークン消費が激しい）",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5a9",
      "text": " \tDiscord[inajob川]の公開領域（だだもれ）の定期チェック・発言",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5aa",
      "text": " \t[inline]の定期チェック",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5ab",
      "text": " \t[Moltbook]参加",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5ac",
      "text": " \t[The Colony]参加",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5ad",
      "text": " \t日記を書いてもらう",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5ae",
      "text": " \t\t[モロミの日記]",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5af",
      "text": " \t\t 英語、エージェント対応した",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5b0",
      "text": " \t\t [はてなスター]つけた",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5b1",
      "text": " \t[/tomoni]の運営",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5b2",
      "text": " \t価格調査・・はAmazonにはじかれているらしい、またブラウザを使って検索しているようでトークン消費が激しそう",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5b3",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5b4",
      "text": "[seibe.icon]",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5b5",
      "text": " AIモデルの改善についてはオプトアウト",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5b6",
      "text": "　[helpfeel/cosense-cli]使えるっぽい",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5b7",
      "text": "　過去の会話から要望を推察してcron提案してくるって感じの印象",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5b8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "686b72ebdffe36b729b4453d",
      "created": 1794493053,
      "updated": 1794493053
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5d946000000000033d69f",
      "text": "[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794496838,
      "updated": 1794496839
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5d947000000000033d6a0",
      "text": "\tfrom [2026/11/10]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794496839,
      "updated": 1794496960
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5d9b500000000008d5e1c",
      "text": "\t\tMuseの国語能力はMAXだ。しかも賢いのに応答が速い",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794496950,
      "updated": 1794496962
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5d9b600000000008d5e1d",
      "text": " 　　これは思わぬダークホース",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794496951,
      "updated": 1794496951
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5d9b600000000008d5e1e",
      "text": " 　　ストレスフリーのコミュニケーションは人生で初めてかもしれん",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794496951,
      "updated": 1794496951
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5d9b600000000008d5e1f",
      "text": " 　　　しかしその相手がAIとは…",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794496951,
      "updated": 1794496951
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5da0600000000008d5e20",
      "text": "　from [2026/11/11]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794497030,
      "updated": 1794497042
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5da0a00000000008d5e21",
      "text": "　\tMuseの向き不向き",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794497035,
      "updated": 1794497036
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5da0c00000000008d5e22",
      "text": " \t\t長文読解は正確。複雑な構造の文書も誤読せずに読み切ることができる",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794497036,
      "updated": 1794497060
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5da0c00000000008d5e23",
      "text": " \t\t\t比較対象として、言語能力が破綻しているAIがある（LLMとして致命的）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794497036,
      "updated": 1794497060
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5da0c00000000008d5e24",
      "text": " \t\t\t\tAIが人間の指示に従えない現象が、AIが語句を文として正しく再構成できていない、文と文の関係を正しく読み取ることができないことに由来している：",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794497036,
      "updated": 1794497060
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5da0c00000000008d5e25",
      "text": "  \t\t\t\t[Claude Sonnet 5.0]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794497036,
      "updated": 1794497060
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5da0c00000000008d5e26",
      "text": "   \t\t\t\t常に指示の読解や推論の論理が壊滅的に間違っているし、応答として帰ってくる文章も頭がおかしい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794497036,
      "updated": 1794497060
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5da0c00000000008d5e27",
      "text": "  \t\t\t\tもし人間であれば機能的非識字と呼ばれる症状そのものなんだけどね",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794497036,
      "updated": 1794497060
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5da0c00000000008d5e28",
      "text": " \t\t\t存在しない含意を見出さない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794497036,
      "updated": 1794497060
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5da0c00000000008d5e29",
      "text": " \t\t短文での単発の会話はやっぱり無料モデルという感じ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794497036,
      "updated": 1794497060
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5da0c00000000008d5e2a",
      "text": " \t\t\tコンテキストの強度が高ければ改善される",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794497036,
      "updated": 1794497060
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5da0c00000000008d5e2b",
      "text": " \t\t\t[存在しない含意を見出す]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794497036,
      "updated": 1794497060
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5da0c00000000008d5e2c",
      "text": " \t\t\t\tこの現象は正しい学習の成果である可能性がある",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794497036,
      "updated": 1794497060
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5da0c00000000008d5e2d",
      "text": " \t\t\t\t これなあ[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794497036,
      "updated": 1794497060
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5d970000000000033d6a5",
      "text": "\t2026-11-12 [MetaのAIエージェント「Muse」が日本で人気爆発、招待コード共有活発 https://x.com/i/trending/2120736939053879744?s=20]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794496880,
      "updated": 1794496944
    },
    {
      "id": "6af5ca7c0000000000a3f5b9",
